{
  "_comment": [
    "Fixed sign-in codes for App Store review accounts — read by",
    "pb_hooks/review_otp.pb.js. Install as /etc/freecaller/review-otp.json,",
    "root:pocketbase, chmod 640 (the hook runs as the pocketbase user).",
    "",
    "Keys are account emails (lowercase), values are the code the reviewer",
    "types. Use 8 digits: the activation screen's second field is numeric and",
    "limited to 8 characters, matching the collection's otp.length.",
    "",
    "For a listed account the EMAILED code stops working — the fixed one is",
    "what validates. Anyone not listed here keeps normal single-use random",
    "codes, so this file is the entire blast radius.",
    "",
    "DELETE THE FILE once review is done. No redeploy, no restart: the hook",
    "reads it per request and does nothing when it is missing.",
    "",
    "Codes belong in the App Review notes next to the email, never in git —",
    "the real file is gitignored. Make each one up with a random generator:",
    "anything memorable (a date, 12345678, digits of pi) is the first thing a",
    "stranger who knows the review address would try.",
    "",
    "The placeholders below are ignored as they stand: the hook only pins a",
    "value that is exactly 8 digits, so installing this template unedited",
    "pins nothing rather than pinning the word REPLACE."
  ],

  "review1@holographica.space": "REPLACE_WITH_8_DIGIT_CODE",
  "review2@holographica.space": "REPLACE_WITH_8_DIGIT_CODE",
  "review3@holographica.space": "REPLACE_WITH_8_DIGIT_CODE"
}
